{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04010","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 刘友贤","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春来日渐赊，琴酒逐年华。\n欲向文通迳，先游武子家。\n池碧新流满，岩红落照斜。\n兴阑情未尽，步步惜风花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘友贤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}